   "description": "The soak: Little Tokyo (with its music) at the Vision Pro's size, generation on, for --seconds (default 900) with a seeded schedule of plausible events (soak.py): re-centre, eye height, gamma, generation off/on and rate, debug logging, tracking blackouts, host and client freezes. Every stall must be explained by an injected freeze; host and probe memory must not grow. Audio events too (the default output muted/unmuted, its volume moved, the default switched and back; the PC's original state is restored; --no-audio leaves them out).",
